  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asian Elephant Conservation Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to: 1) At least 15 days per month on patrol for each RPU; 2)Appropriate action against attempts to shoot or poison elephants, in areas covered by the RPUs. No traps permitted to be placed or to remain long enough to entrap elephants (or other threatened species); 3) Apprehension of, or at least identification to the local authorities, of all suspected poachers so they can be prosecuted; 4) Continuation of the monitoring of elephant populations (and other threatened species).</narrative>
  </description>
